               <title value="Hospital course note"/>
               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 20-year-old female patient, admitted on 13/01/2021 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection (positive PCR). On admission, she presented with fever, dry cough, and dyspnoea. Chest X-ray and CT thorax confirmed bilateral pneumonia. Blood tests revealed elevated inflammatory markers (CRP, ferritin, D-dimer). Arterial blood gases showed mild hypoxaemia, requiring supplemental oxygen therapy. Vital signs and pulse oximetry were monitored continuously. She received dexamethasone and anticoagulation therapy. Intravenous fluids were administered initially. Respiratory physiotherapy was initiated early and proved beneficial. Clinical improvement was steady, with oxygen requirements resolving by day eight. She was discharged on 26/01/2021 in stable condition, with advice on further recovery at home. Please ensure follow-up within two weeks and reassess respiratory function. Should symptoms worsen, readmission should be considered promptly.</div>
               </text>
